*> Worldgen features, part 4 (docs/protocol/35-worldgen-features-4-decorators-and-vegetation.md): the draw conventions of section 1.1 and the direction tables as pure
*> programs; the random patch idiom of section 2 and simple_block of section 4 are placed by feat-run.cob (FR-PLACE-PF) and tested through it.
*>
*> Entry points (state is an XR-STATE):
*>   F354-BETWEEN-INCLUSIVE USING state, low, high, result out        nextIntBetweenInclusive: nextInt(high - low + 1) + low
*>   F354-MTH-NEXT-INT USING state, low, high, result out             Mth.nextInt: low when low >= high, else the line above
*>   F354-SHUFFLE USING state, count, list (BINARY-LONG x 64)         Util.shuffle: for i = count down to 2: j = nextInt(i); swap elements i - 1 and j
*>   F354-PICK USING state, size, index out                           Util.getRandom: one nextInt(size), also for a size of 1
*>   F354-TRAPEZOID USING state, min, max, plateau, result out        TrapezoidInt.sample (section 2.2)
*>   F354-PLANE-DIRECTION USING index (0 to 3), direction out         Direction.Plane.HORIZONTAL: NORTH, EAST, SOUTH, WEST (ordinals DOWN 0, UP 1, NORTH 2, SOUTH 3, WEST 4, EAST 5)
*>   F354-CLOCKWISE USING direction, direction out                    getClockWise on the horizontal plane
*>   F354-FROM-2D USING index, direction out                          Direction.from2DDataValue: SOUTH, WEST, NORTH, EAST by |index mod 4| (Java remainder)

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. F354-BETWEEN-INCLUSIVE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-BOUND               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-A                   BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY XORO REPLACING LEADING ==XR-== BY ==L-==.
 01 L-LOW                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-HIGH                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-RESULT               BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-STATE L-LOW L-HIGH L-RESULT.
     COMPUTE WS-BOUND = L-HIGH - L-LOW + 1
     CALL "WGR-NEXT-INT-BOUND" USING L-STATE WS-BOUND WS-A
     COMPUTE L-RESULT = WS-A + L-LOW
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM F354-BETWEEN-INCLUSIVE.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. F354-MTH-NEXT-INT.
 DATA DIVISION.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY XORO REPLACING LEADING ==XR-== BY ==L-==.
 01 L-LOW                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-HIGH                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-RESULT               BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-STATE L-LOW L-HIGH L-RESULT.
     CALL "FR-NI" USING L-STATE L-LOW L-HIGH L-RESULT
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM F354-MTH-NEXT-INT.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. F354-SHUFFLE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-I                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-J                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-T                   BINARY-LONG.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY XORO REPLACING LEADING ==XR-== BY ==L-==.
 01 L-COUNT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-LIST.
    05 L-ITEM              BINARY-LONG OCCURS 64 TIMES.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-STATE L-COUNT L-LIST.
     PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM L-COUNT BY -1 UNTIL WS-I < 2
         CALL "WGR-NEXT-INT-BOUND" USING L-STATE WS-I WS-J
         MOVE L-ITEM(WS-I) TO WS-T
         MOVE L-ITEM(WS-J + 1) TO L-ITEM(WS-I)
         MOVE WS-T TO L-ITEM(WS-J + 1)
     END-PERFORM
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM F354-SHUFFLE.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. F354-PICK.
 DATA DIVISION.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY XORO REPLACING LEADING ==XR-== BY ==L-==.
 01 L-SIZE                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-INDEX                BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-STATE L-SIZE L-INDEX.
     CALL "WGR-NEXT-INT-BOUND" USING L-STATE L-SIZE L-INDEX
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM F354-PICK.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. F354-TRAPEZOID.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-P.
    05 WS-V                BINARY-LONG OCCURS 4 TIMES.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 COPY XORO REPLACING LEADING ==XR-== BY ==L-==.
 01 L-MIN                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-MAX                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-PLATEAU              BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-RESULT               BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-STATE L-MIN L-MAX L-PLATEAU L-RESULT.
     MOVE 5 TO WS-V(1)
     MOVE L-MIN TO WS-V(2)
     MOVE L-MAX TO WS-V(3)
     MOVE L-PLATEAU TO WS-V(4)
     CALL "FR-INT-SAMPLE" USING L-STATE WS-P L-RESULT
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM F354-TRAPEZOID.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. F354-PLANE-DIRECTION.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-PLANE.
    05 FILLER BINARY-LONG VALUE 2.
    05 FILLER BINARY-LONG VALUE 5.
    05 FILLER BINARY-LONG VALUE 3.
    05 FILLER BINARY-LONG VALUE 4.
 01 WS-TABLE REDEFINES WS-PLANE.
    05 WS-D BINARY-LONG OCCURS 4 TIMES.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-INDEX                BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-DIRECTION            BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-INDEX L-DIRECTION.
     MOVE WS-D(L-INDEX + 1) TO L-DIRECTION
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM F354-PLANE-DIRECTION.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. F354-CLOCKWISE.
 DATA DIVISION.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-DIRECTION            BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-OUT                  BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-DIRECTION L-OUT.
     EVALUATE L-DIRECTION
         WHEN 2
             MOVE 5 TO L-OUT
         WHEN 5
             MOVE 3 TO L-OUT
         WHEN 3
             MOVE 4 TO L-OUT
         WHEN OTHER
             MOVE 2 TO L-OUT
     END-EVALUATE
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM F354-CLOCKWISE.

 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. F354-FROM-2D.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 01 WS-M                   BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-PLANE.
    05 FILLER BINARY-LONG VALUE 3.
    05 FILLER BINARY-LONG VALUE 4.
    05 FILLER BINARY-LONG VALUE 2.
    05 FILLER BINARY-LONG VALUE 5.
 01 WS-TABLE REDEFINES WS-PLANE.
    05 WS-D BINARY-LONG OCCURS 4 TIMES.
 LINKAGE SECTION.
 01 L-INDEX                BINARY-LONG.
 01 L-DIRECTION            BINARY-LONG.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING L-INDEX L-DIRECTION.
     COMPUTE WS-M = FUNCTION ABS(L-INDEX - 4 * FUNCTION INTEGER-PART(L-INDEX / 4))
     MOVE WS-D(WS-M + 1) TO L-DIRECTION
     GOBACK.
 END PROGRAM F354-FROM-2D.
